---
title: "图 12：Candidate 双路径资格与正式产品发布"
---
flowchart LR
    CHANGE["Product Change"]
    VERIFY["Focused Tests<br/>verify:local / verify:local:full"]
    MAIN["Canonical main SHA"]
    BUILD["Build Candidate"]
    CANDIDATE["不可变 Candidate<br/>SHA + Multi-arch Digest"]
    BUNDLE["Portable Bundle<br/>Compose + Contracts + Manifest + SHA256SUMS"]
    LOCAL["Local-Docker<br/>Clean-host Qualification"]
    LOCAL_RECEIPT["Local Qualification Receipt"]
    INSTANCE["opl-instance-medopl<br/>Protected Deployment"]
    TKE["Tencent/TKE Qualification<br/>Readback + Executed Rollback"]
    INSTANCE_RECEIPT["Instance Qualification Receipt"]
    GATE["Product Release Admission"]
    PUBLISH["授权发布者手动发布<br/>Promote Existing Bytes"]
    OUTPUT["Output（固定）<br/>OPL Cloud Release"]
    CURRENT_GAP["当前缺口<br/>正式 workflow 仍 rebuild"]

    CHANGE --> VERIFY
    VERIFY --> MAIN
    MAIN --> BUILD
    BUILD --> CANDIDATE
    BUILD --> BUNDLE
    CANDIDATE --> LOCAL
    BUNDLE --> LOCAL
    LOCAL --> LOCAL_RECEIPT
    CANDIDATE --> INSTANCE
    BUNDLE --> INSTANCE
    INSTANCE --> TKE
    TKE --> INSTANCE_RECEIPT
    LOCAL_RECEIPT --> GATE
    INSTANCE_RECEIPT --> GATE
    CANDIDATE --> GATE
    GATE --> PUBLISH
    PUBLISH --> OUTPUT
    CURRENT_GAP -. "必须关闭后才能发布后继版本" .-> PUBLISH
